   "type": "text",
   "text": "THE CONTEXT GATE (spans all five) \u2014 \"Only agents with the product's world context installed may author research prompts, run adversarial\npasses, or weigh in on architecture questions\u2026 research shaped by someone who does not know what the product is for returns answers to\nthe wrong question, FLUENTLY.\"",
   "originalText": "THE CONTEXT GATE (spans all five) \u2014 \"Only agents with the product's world context installed may author research prompts, run adversarial\npasses, or weigh in on architecture questions\u2026 research shaped by someone who does not know what the product is for returns answers to\nthe wrong question, FLUENTLY.\"",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
